+</div>
+</div>
+</div>
+
+<p>For the latest information about developments related to Pub. 551, such as legislation enacted after this publication was published, go to <a class="ulink" href="https://www.irs.gov/uac/about-publication-551" target="_top" rel="noopener">IRS.gov/Pub551</a>.</p>
